// BT-3136 (ADR 0111 close-out): the `^` here is foreign to
// LoopNlrShadowDriver countedRun:over:'s frame (same shape as
// fixtures/collection_probe.bt's escapeAfterCountedRun:), but the block
// first drives aCounter's stateful whileTrue: loop (loop_nlr_shadow_counter.bt)
// — so the escape happens after both a loop-threaded actor-state mutation
// and the driver's own class-var mutation have already committed, in the
// same flow.

Value subclass: LoopNlrShadowProbe

  class escapeAfterLoopAndCountedRun: aList :: List with: aCounter :: LoopNlrShadowCounter -> Integer =>
    LoopNlrShadowDriver
      countedRun: [:x |
        aCounter runTo: x
        x > 1 ifTrue: [^x]
      ]
      over: aList
    0
